    "text": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 3;\n    int values[3] = {3, -1, 2};\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) {\n        sum = sum + values[i];\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
